Fixes:
- Write colours with transparency through color-mix instead of appending a hex alpha, so rgb(), hsl(), oklch() and 3- or 8-digit hex colours keep their tints.
- Key repeated rows by their place in the list, so two rows with the same text both draw and keep their own state.
- A parent or merge pointing at a missing or later commit crashed, lane 1 took the second branch colour, a negative lane had no colour, and ten or more commits ran off the frame; such links fall back to the previous commit or are dropped, lanes start at 0 with lane 1 taking the first branch colour, and the window shrinks to fit its commits.

